Description: configure Linux boards over SSH or through offline boot media
 Configure Raspberry Pi 4 and 5 boards through a compact menuconfig interface
 or Kconfig profiles. Manage users, serial consoles, network settings, SSH,
 system defaults and hardware boot parameters.
 .
 Changes are previewed and backed up before application. Running boards are
 reached through SSH; SD cards, disk images and extracted root filesystems
 can be configured without executing their programs on the host.
